'''Checkered Skirt''' (チェックのスカート, ''Chekku no Sukāto'', '''Checkered Skirt''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Research Power UP (Sm): All Cats' recharge times are reduced by 26 frames (0.87 sec).

